    {
      "text": "Figure 4 outlines the research agenda for LLM-based multi-agent systems in software engineering, divided into Phase 1 (Enhancing Individual Agent Capabilities: refining role-playing capabilities, designing robust and adaptable prompting frameworks) and Phase 2 (Optimizing Agent Synergy: human-agent collaboration, benchmarking, scaling up for complex projects, leveraging industry principles, dynamic adaptation of agents and resources, secure and responsible data management).",
